'''Frosted''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 2nd tier in the Main Event during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is gray with a frosted texture over it, hence the name. The guard is gray, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*It has a [[Frosted (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name.

